{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方昨晚（17日）10時許時於天水圍拘捕一名67歲男子，涉嫌「未經許可在限制飛行區以內飛行」及「操作期間違反操作規定」。警員在行動中檢獲一部小型無人機，被捕人現正被扣留調查。案件交由元朗警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p>\n<p>警方提醒，為配合於深圳舉行的亞太經合組織第33次領導人非正式會議，香港已設立臨時限制飛行區。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.197865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:43:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:14.624042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:39:07.096471+00:00","content_hash":"82edf56678914404a36d682543906ba780f892806e53541800bf92f9df17aff2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.197865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}